# Connect (plumbing only)

`generate` every 30s, then `http` GET `https://api.github.com/events?per_page=100&page=N` across **multiple pages** so each sweep covers more of the timeline. Headers: `GITHUB_TOKEN`, a non-empty `User-Agent`, `Accept: application/vnd.github+json`. Rate-limit the GETs so that sweep can finish inside the interval.

- Explode each page JSON **array** into one message per event before filter.
- Keep `PullRequestEvent` where `payload.action` is in an allowlist (`opened` only for v1).
- Cap **1** surviving message per generate sweep (`batch_index() >= 1` → `deleted()`), then cache.
- Project the work-topic schema in `.cursor/spec/architecture.md`. One Bloblang mapping; `mapping` rebuilds `root`.
- Cache on GitHub event `id`. Produce `github.pr.opened`.
- Never call Ollama / OpenAI from Connect.

```bloblang
# ❌ BAD — `allow` is this.allow; let vars are $name
!allow.contains(this.payload.action)

# ✅ GOOD
let allow = ["opened"]
!$allow.contains(this.payload.action.or(""))
```

Details: `.cursor/spec/architecture.md` (Connect section).
